  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Yu Lu blessed land it is drizzling, with a thin fog in the air. Shark Demon shouts not to let the rain touch anyone, because it can consume immortal essence. The immortals put up defenses. The drizzle penetrates everything. An immortal zombie asks if this drizzle is that rain. Another says even that rain should not ignore their defenses so completely.",
      "chapters": [
        818
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_yu_lu_blessed_land",
        "char_shark_demon"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Su Bai Man gives the paired cause. In the previous round they were hit by raindrop equity. Thus, in this round, their defenses have no use against vanishing immortal essence dissipation rain. They can only let it touch them. Before they have even fought, the rain is already vaporizing their immortal essence bead by bead. A battlefield killer move with no attacking power and a huge range is used with the rain to drain them. They call that battlefield move Fairy Yu Lu’s personal creation, and say it was not recorded in history.",
      "chapters": [
        818
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_su_bai_man",
        "char_fairy_yu_lu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After they force a way out with incomplete Profound Ice House, Tai Bai Yun Sheng says the rain is too powerful. Even that Immortal Gu House could not defend against it. They were still hit.",
      "chapters": [
        818
      ],
